sentences.text:
In this view of the matter,
following order is passed:-
ORDER (i) The Criminal Writ Petition is partly allowed;
(ii) The petition is dismissed against petitioner No.1, as not pressed;
(iv) The order dated 28/06/2023 is quashed and set aside, only to the extent of petitioner Nos.2 to 7;
 (v) Rule is made absolute in above terms.

